{"id":"stress","lemma":"stress","pos":"noun","rank":2176,"glosses":["stress (emotional pressure)"],"ipa":"/stʁɛs/","gender":"m","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-stress.wav","examples":[{"text":"Comment gères-tu le stress ?","en":"How do you handle stress?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to manage","l":"gérer"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Il est nécessaire d'éviter le stress.","en":"It's necessary to avoid stress.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"necessary"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to avoid"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Elle est incapable de gérer le stress.","en":"She is unable to cope with stress.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"unable, incapable"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to manage"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Le karaoké est bon pour diminuer le stress.","en":"Karaoke is good for reducing stress.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"karaoke"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to diminish"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Un poing fermé peut être une indication de stress.","en":"A closed fist can indicate stress.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"fist"},{"g":"closed"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"direction, instruction"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}